*> conditional_if_else.cbl -- demonstrates: IF/ELSE with END-IF, a
*> compound condition using AND, and an IF with no ELSE branch.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CONDIFELSE.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-ITEM-COUNT   PIC 9(4) VALUE 150.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    IF WS-ITEM-COUNT > 100
        DISPLAY "BULK ORDER"
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "STANDARD ORDER"
    END-IF.

    IF WS-ITEM-COUNT > 0 AND WS-ITEM-COUNT < 200
        DISPLAY "WITHIN NORMAL RANGE"
    END-IF.

    IF WS-ITEM-COUNT = 150
        DISPLAY "EXACTLY ONE FIFTY"
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.
